>>SOURCE FORMAT FREE
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. LEGACY-DISTANCE.

DATA DIVISION.
LOCAL-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-OP PIC X(16) VALUE SPACES.
01 WS-TEXT PIC X(8192) VALUE SPACES.
01 WS-TEXT-LEN PIC 9(18) COMP-5 VALUE 0.
01 WS-CMP PIC S9(4) COMP-5 VALUE 0.
01 WS-STATUS PIC 9(4) COMP-5 VALUE 0.
01 WS-FAILED PIC 9(4) COMP-5 VALUE 0.
01 WS-CLEAN PIC 9(4) COMP-5 VALUE 0.
01 WS-C-TAG.
   05 CT-SIGN PIC S9(4) COMP-5 VALUE 0.
   05 CT-CHUNKS PIC 9(18) COMP-5 VALUE 0.
   05 CT-HEAD USAGE POINTER.
   05 CT-TAIL USAGE POINTER.
01 WS-T-TAG.
   05 TT-SIGN PIC S9(4) COMP-5 VALUE 0.
   05 TT-CHUNKS PIC 9(18) COMP-5 VALUE 0.
   05 TT-HEAD USAGE POINTER.
   05 TT-TAIL USAGE POINTER.
01 WS-EMPTY-A.
   05 EA-SIGN PIC S9(4) COMP-5 VALUE 0.
   05 EA-CHUNKS PIC 9(18) COMP-5 VALUE 0.
   05 EA-HEAD USAGE POINTER.
   05 EA-TAIL USAGE POINTER.
01 WS-EMPTY-B.
   05 EB-SIGN PIC S9(4) COMP-5 VALUE 0.
   05 EB-CHUNKS PIC 9(18) COMP-5 VALUE 0.
   05 EB-HEAD USAGE POINTER.
   05 EB-TAIL USAGE POINTER.
01 WS-EMPTY-REM.
   05 ER-SIGN PIC S9(4) COMP-5 VALUE 0.
   05 ER-CHUNKS PIC 9(18) COMP-5 VALUE 0.
   05 ER-HEAD USAGE POINTER.
   05 ER-TAIL USAGE POINTER.

LINKAGE SECTION.
01 LK-C-DAY.
   05 LC-SIGN PIC S9(4) COMP-5.
   05 LC-CHUNKS PIC 9(18) COMP-5.
   05 LC-HEAD USAGE POINTER.
   05 LC-TAIL USAGE POINTER.
01 LK-T-DAY.
   05 LT-SIGN PIC S9(4) COMP-5.
   05 LT-CHUNKS PIC 9(18) COMP-5.
   05 LT-HEAD USAGE POINTER.
   05 LT-TAIL USAGE POINTER.
01 LK-RESULT.
   05 LR-SIGN PIC S9(4) COMP-5.
   05 LR-CHUNKS PIC 9(18) COMP-5.
   05 LR-HEAD USAGE POINTER.
   05 LR-TAIL USAGE POINTER.
01 LK-STATUS PIC 9(4) COMP-5.

PROCEDURE DIVISION USING LK-C-DAY LK-T-DAY LK-RESULT LK-STATUS.
MAIN.
    SET CT-HEAD CT-TAIL TT-HEAD TT-TAIL
        EA-HEAD EA-TAIL EB-HEAD EB-TAIL
        ER-HEAD ER-TAIL TO NULL
    MOVE 0 TO LK-STATUS WS-STATUS WS-FAILED WS-CLEAN
    *> 两个输入都由调用者拥有。只允许写入空结果槽。
    IF LR-SIGN NOT = 0 OR LR-CHUNKS NOT = 0
       OR LR-HEAD NOT = NULL OR LR-TAIL NOT = NULL
        MOVE 175 TO LK-STATUS
        GOBACK
    END-IF
    IF LC-SIGN < -1 OR LC-SIGN > 1
       OR LT-SIGN < -1 OR LT-SIGN > 1
        MOVE 22 TO LK-STATUS
        GOBACK
    END-IF

    *> 第三次历史错误：从已经修补的日标签推导距离。
    CALL "PATCHED-DAY-TAG" USING LK-C-DAY WS-C-TAG WS-STATUS
    IF WS-STATUS NOT = 0
        MOVE WS-STATUS TO WS-FAILED
        PERFORM CLEANUP
        MOVE WS-FAILED TO LK-STATUS
        GOBACK
    END-IF
    CALL "PATCHED-DAY-TAG" USING LK-T-DAY WS-T-TAG WS-STATUS
    IF WS-STATUS NOT = 0
        MOVE WS-STATUS TO WS-FAILED
        PERFORM CLEANUP
        MOVE WS-FAILED TO LK-STATUS
        GOBACK
    END-IF

    MOVE "SUB" TO WS-OP
    CALL "BIG-INTEGER-SERVICE" USING
        WS-OP WS-TEXT WS-TEXT-LEN
        WS-T-TAG WS-C-TAG LK-RESULT
        WS-EMPTY-REM WS-CMP WS-STATUS
    IF WS-STATUS NOT = 0
        MOVE WS-STATUS TO WS-FAILED
    ELSE
        IF LR-SIGN < 0 MOVE 1 TO LR-SIGN END-IF
    END-IF
    PERFORM CLEANUP
    IF WS-FAILED NOT = 0
        MOVE "FREE-A" TO WS-OP
        MOVE 0 TO WS-CLEAN
        CALL "BIG-INTEGER-SERVICE" USING
            WS-OP WS-TEXT WS-TEXT-LEN
            LK-RESULT WS-EMPTY-B WS-EMPTY-A
            WS-EMPTY-REM WS-CMP WS-CLEAN
    END-IF
    MOVE WS-FAILED TO LK-STATUS
    GOBACK.

CLEANUP.
    MOVE "FREE-A" TO WS-OP
    MOVE 0 TO WS-CLEAN
    CALL "BIG-INTEGER-SERVICE" USING
        WS-OP WS-TEXT WS-TEXT-LEN
        WS-C-TAG WS-EMPTY-B WS-EMPTY-A
        WS-EMPTY-REM WS-CMP WS-CLEAN
    IF WS-CLEAN NOT = 0 AND WS-FAILED = 0
        MOVE WS-CLEAN TO WS-FAILED
    END-IF
    MOVE 0 TO WS-CLEAN
    CALL "BIG-INTEGER-SERVICE" USING
        WS-OP WS-TEXT WS-TEXT-LEN
        WS-T-TAG WS-EMPTY-B WS-EMPTY-A
        WS-EMPTY-REM WS-CMP WS-CLEAN
    IF WS-CLEAN NOT = 0 AND WS-FAILED = 0
        MOVE WS-CLEAN TO WS-FAILED
    END-IF.
END PROGRAM LEGACY-DISTANCE.
